B.aec={"Resume Hosting":0,[u.cS]:1,Dismiss:2,"is a phone and web dice game developed with Flutter and Dart. It supports human and robot players, upper and lower section scoring, an upper-section bonus, a Five of a Kind bonus, saved player history, hints, and shared T-G-Apps presentation.":3,"Player 1 is always Human in Pass-and-Play.":4,"The room has started successfully.":5,[u.k]:6,"If I Disconnect":7,[u.a5]:8,"Abandon hand":9,"Robot plays for me until I reconnect":10,"The host has disconnected.":11,[u.a]:12,"One player creates the room and shares its six-character code. Other human players join that room from their phones.":13,"Multi-phone games are human-only. The host phone may also control local human seats for combined Pass-and-Play.":14,"Firebase uses an anonymous app identity for each phone. Players do not need to share email addresses or Google accounts.":15,"5 of a Kind Bonus \u2022 automatic":16,[u.L]:17,"All players are human. \u201cHuman on this phone\u201d seats use Pass-and-Play on the host phone; Remote human seats are claimed from other phones.":18,"Player 1 is always a human controlled by the host phone.":19,"Total of all 1s.":20,"Total of all 2s.":21,"Total of all 3s.":22,"Total of all 4s.":23,"Total of all 5s.":24,"Total of all 6s.":25,[u.n]:26,[u.p]:27,[u.X]:28,[u.aX]:29,"Four consecutive dice. Scores 30.":30,"Five consecutive dice. Scores 40.":31,"All five dice match. Scores 50.":32,"Score the total of all dice.":33,"categories complete":34,"Roll to begin your turn.":35,[u.N]:36,"No bonus points yet":37,"63 points earns the 35-point upper bonus":38,[u.Q]:39,[u.H]:40,"Leave this multi-phone game?":41,[u.R]:42,[u.f]:43,[u.B]:44,"Firebase sign-in could not be completed.":45,"Firebase could not complete the request.":46,"The multi-phone game is complete.":47,"Waiting for the host to start the game.":48,[u.F]:49,"Volume:":50,[u.x]:51,[u.D]:52,"Human on host phone":53,"Remote human":54,"Waiting for remote human":55,"A multi-phone game requires at least one Remote human.":56,[u.P]:57,"Leave this multi-phone room?":58,"The lobby could not be loaded.":59,[u.c8]:60,"That T-G-Apps YZ room code is invalid or expired.":61,"Room could not be joined.":62,"The T-G-Apps YZ room no longer exists.":63,"This game has already started.":64,"All remote-player positions in this room are filled.":65,"Waiting for players.":66,"Waiting for remote players to join.":67,"The game has started.":68,"Robot Players":69,"use a combination of statistical chances of achieving each open scoring category, subject to a strategic system that considers fallback options if an objective is not achieved and what to sacrifice for least final score damage in this eventuality.":70,"The system offers a \u201cHint\u201d button for human players; it reports what the Robot player would do given the Player\u2019s game card thus far and the dice and turn so far. Due to the complexity of the statistical process, hints may seem counter-intuitive or mistaken; like breaking a made hand to try for something else. Please do not report odd Hints as bugs.":71,"Send questions, concerns, or complaints to":72,", used as the application framework and programming language.":73,", used for local player history.":74,", used for shared T-G-Apps music support and dice sound effects.":75,", including privacy policy, exit flow, and game hints components.":76,"\xa9 2026 T-G-Apps. All rights reserved.":77,"T-G-Apps YZ How to Play":78,"T-G-Apps YZ \u2014 How to Play":79,"Tap the dice you want to hold. Dice toggle between green (HOLD, will not reroll) and red (REROLL).":80,"Score the total of the matching dice: Ones, Twos, Threes, Fours, Fives, and Sixes.":81,"Bonus:":82,"If your total in the upper section is 63 or higher, you receive an additional 35 points. T-G-Apps YZ shows your upper total so far, and if you have not yet reached 63 points, the number of additional points you need to get the bonus.":83,"\u2014 at least 4 sequential numbers ([1,2,3,4], [2,3,4,5], [3,4,5,6]). A large straight can also be scored as a small straight. Fixed score.":84,"\u2014 5 sequential numbers ([1,2,3,4,5] or [2,3,4,5,6]). Fixed score.":85,"\u2014 3 of one number and 2 of another. Five of a kind can also be scored as a full house. Fixed score.":86,"\u2014 two sets of two numbers (example: 2-2 and 5-5). Four of a kind, full house, and five of a kind can all be scored as two pair. Score equals the total of all dice.":87,"\u2014 at least 3 matching dice. Four of a kind and five of a kind can be scored as 3 of a kind. Score equals the total of all dice.":88,"\u2014 at least 4 matching dice. Five of a kind can be scored as 4 of a kind. Score equals the total of all dice.":89,"\u2014 all five dice match. High-value category.":90,"After scoring your first 5 of a Kind, each additional 5 of a Kind adds 100 bonus points in the 5 of a Kind Bonus scorecard entry, automatically.":91,"If you scored zero in 5 of a Kind, any subsequent 5-of-a-kind roll does not award any 5 of a Kind bonus points.":92,"You must still choose a category to score. Scoring an additional 5 of a Kind in the upper section scores the selected category normally; for example, [2,2,2,2,2] scores 10 in Twos or zero in Sixes. If you already have a successful 5 of a Kind score, the extra 100-point bonus is still added automatically.":93,"Oops (Last Category)":94,"Player 1 must always be a Human player":95,", regardless of the name entered for Player 1.":96,"Players 2 through 6 may be Human or Robot players.":97,"Human players sharing a phone pass the device to the player whose turn is shown.":98,"Multi-Phone Play (In Development)":99,"Every player in a multi-phone game must be Human.":100,"Robot players cannot be added to a multi-phone room.":101,"A multi-phone game may combine people sharing the host phone with remote people using other phones. Every seat is still occupied by a human player.":102,"The host creates the game and shares its room code. Remote players enter the code and their player name, join an available remote seat, and indicate when they are ready. A Google account is not required to join.":103,"The host starts the game after the required players have joined and are ready.":104,"Only the active player controls that turn. Other phones show the play as it happens but cannot change the active player's choices.":105,"When the active player selects dice to hold or release, those dice change between green and red on every connected phone.":106,"When the active player rolls, every phone shows the roll and then displays the same final dice values.":107,"When a score is selected, every phone moves to the chosen category and shows the category and points scored.":108,"Turn notices, ready status, connection status, and interim game messages are shared with all connected players.":109,"If a phone briefly disconnects, it reloads the latest official game state after reconnecting.":110,"Multi-phone synchronization:":111,"When the host starts the room, every phone opens the shared game automatically. Dice holds, rolling animation, final dice values, score selections, turns, totals, and game-over results are synchronized. Only the phone controlling the active player can make a choice. The host phone securely resolves dice rolls and publishes the authoritative game state, while reconnecting phones rebuild the game from Firebase.":112,"T-G-Apps YZ Release Log":113,"Current release: 1.1.0":114,"(build 2)":115,"Release 1.1.0":116,"Major feature release":117,"July 28, 2026":118,"Switched background music to the shared TAG_Music package and fixed a bug where the dice-roll sound effect could permanently pause the background music.":119,"Restyled Setup and Game screens with a gold-and-felt-green theme to match T-G-Apps 21, including gold buttons, app bars, and a redesigned Hint button.":120,"Replaced white score, status, and history panels with gold-bordered gradient boxes.":121,"Release 1.0.0":122,"T-G-Apps YZ History":123,"Saved results for named human players. Up to 500 entries are retained. Entries are listed newest first.":124,"Only completed human players with custom names are saved. Default names such as Player 1 are not stored.":125,"Upper:":126,"Lower:":127,"Final:":128,[u.r]:129,[u.M]:130,[u.C]:131,[u.m]:132,[u.y]:133,[u._]:134,[u.A]:135,[u.G]:136,[u.Z]:137,and:138,"T-G-Apps shared packages":139,"The current player":140,"No clear target yet":141,"Matching dice":142,"T-G-Apps Game Catalog":143,"Visual HTML version: 2026-08-30A":144,"Current and in-production T-G-Apps games and their intended audiences.":145,"Audience Policy":146,[u.O]:147,"Current Apps":148,"Dice scorecard strategy":149,"A dice strategy game with human and robot players, scorecard decisions, animated dice, music, backgrounds, and game history.":150,"Current app":151,"Children &amp; Adults":152,"No wagering":153,"A blackjack game with dealer play, robot opponents, casino-style betting, chips, insurance, and configurable table rules.":154,"Adults 13+":155,"Simulated betting":156,"Texas Hold&#39;em poker":157,"A Texas Hold&#39;em poker game with human and robot players, betting rounds, chips, community cards, and showdown play.":158,"Seven-card stud poker":159,"A fixed-limit stud poker game with private and exposed cards, betting rounds, chips, and human or robot opponents.":160,"Seven-card draw poker":161,"A seven-card draw-poker game with betting, chips, card exchange, and robot strategy.":162,"In Production":163,"Five-card draw poker":164,"Classic draw poker centered on a single five-card hand, opening betting, one draw, final betting, and standard hand rankings.":165,"In production":166,"Domino tile strategy":167,"A phone-friendly dominoes game built around matching tiles, blocking play, tactical scoring, and clear shared-table presentation.":168,"Mahjong tile strategy":169,"Six mahjong games: Hong Kong, Riichi, Chinese Official, Taiwanese, Sichuan, and Solitaire, with robot opponents, hints, and game history.":170,"A cribbage game covering the deal, discard to the crib, pegging, hand counting, and the race to the winning score.":171,"A trick-taking game focused on avoiding penalty cards, tracking played suits, and deciding when to attempt shooting the moon.":172,"A partnership trick-taking game planned around bidding, making contracts, managing bags, and coordinating through card play.":173,"A fast partnership card game covering trump selection, bowers, trick strategy, going alone, and concise round scoring.":174,"Farkle dice":175,"A push-your-luck dice game planned around scoring combinations, banking points, reroll decisions, and the risk of a scoreless turn.":176,Back:177,"T-G-Apps LLC Privacy Policy":178,"Visual HTML version: 2026-08-22B":179,"Privacy Policy for T-G-Apps LLC apps, games, websites, and related services.":180,"Effective Date: June 2, 2026":181,"T-G-Apps LLC (&ldquo;we,&rdquo; &ldquo;our,&rdquo; or &ldquo;us&rdquo;) respects your privacy. This Privacy Policy explains how information may be collected, used, and shared when you use our mobile applications, games, websites, and related services.":182,"Covered Products":183,"Related websites and online services":184,"1. Information We Collect":185,"Our Services may collect limited information automatically through third-party service providers.":186,"Device type":187,"Operating system version":188,"Mobile advertising identifiers":189,"IP address":190,"Approximate geographic region":191,"App usage information":192,"Crash reports and diagnostics":193,"Ad interaction information":194,"We generally do not collect personally identifying information such as your real name, physical address, or phone number unless you voluntarily provide it.":195,"2. Advertising":196,"Our Services may display advertisements provided by third-party advertising partners, including Google AdMob.":197,"Advertising providers may use cookies, mobile advertising identifiers, and similar technologies to deliver advertisements, measure ad performance, limit repetitive advertisements, and personalize advertising content.":198,"Google may collect and process data in accordance with its own privacy policies.":199,"Google Privacy Policy":200,"How Google Uses Information from Sites and Apps":201,"3. Analytics and Diagnostics":202,"We may use third-party analytics or crash reporting services to improve our Services. These services may collect device information, usage statistics, error reports, and performance diagnostics.":203,"This information helps us improve game stability, usability, and performance.":204,"4. Cookies and Similar Technologies":205,"Our websites and advertising providers may use cookies, local storage, mobile advertising identifiers, and similar technologies to remember preferences, measure website traffic, support advertising functionality, and improve user experience.":206,"Users may disable cookies through browser settings, though some features may not function properly.":207,"5. Children&#39;s Privacy":208,"Our Services are intended for a general audience. We do not knowingly collect personal information from children under the age of 13. If we become aware that personal information from a child under 13 has been collected improperly, we will take reasonable steps to delete such information.":209,"Parents who believe their child has provided personal information may contact us using the information below.":210,"6. Data Sharing":211,"We do not sell personal information. We may share limited data with advertising providers, analytics providers, hosting providers, and legal authorities when required by law.":212,"Such sharing is limited to what is reasonably necessary to operate and improve the Services.":213,"7. Data Security":214,"We take reasonable measures to help protect information associated with our Services. However, no method of electronic transmission or storage is completely secure, and we cannot guarantee absolute security.":215,"8. Third-Party Links and Services":216,"Our Services may contain links to third-party websites or services. We are not responsible for the privacy practices of third-party providers. Users should review the privacy policies of those third parties separately.":217,"9. Your Rights and Choices":218,"Depending on your location, you may have rights regarding access to information, deletion requests, restricting certain data processing, and advertising preferences.":219,"Many mobile devices allow users to reset or limit advertising identifiers through device settings.":220,"10. Changes to This Privacy Policy":221,"We may update this Privacy Policy periodically. Changes become effective when posted on this page. Continued use of the Services after updates constitutes acceptance of the revised policy.":222,"11. Contact Information":223,"Contact Email:":224,[u.q]:225}
B.a7z=s(["Reanudar como anfitri\xf3n","Reprendre en tant qu\u2019h\xf4te","Als Host fortsetzen","Retomar como anfitri\xe3o","\u30db\u30b9\u30c8\u3068\u3057\u3066\u518d\u958b","\u0939\u094b\u0938\u094d\u091f \u0915\u0947 \u0930\u0942\u092a \u092e\u0947\u0902 \u092b\u093f\u0930 \u0938\u0947 \u0936\u0941\u0930\u0942 \u0915\u0930\u0947\u0902","Lanjutkan sebagai Host","Ti\u1ebfp t\u1ee5c v\u1edbi vai tr\xf2 ch\u1ee7 tr\xec"],t.s)
B.aae=s(["Creaste una sala multitel\xe9fono que sigue esperando. Vuelve a conectarte para seguir siendo el anfitri\xf3n.","Vous avez cr\xe9\xe9 une salle multi-t\xe9l\xe9phone qui attend toujours. Reconnectez-vous pour continuer \xe0 l\u2019h\xe9berger.","Du hast einen Mehrger\xe4te-Raum erstellt, der noch wartet. Verbinde dich erneut, um ihn weiter zu hosten.","Voc\xea criou uma sala para v\xe1rios celulares que ainda est\xe1 esperando. Reconecte-se para continuar como anfitri\xe3o.","\u3042\u306a\u305f\u304c\u4f5c\u6210\u3057\u305f\u8907\u6570\u7aef\u672b\u306e\u30eb\u30fc\u30e0\u304c\u307e\u3060\u5f85\u6a5f\u4e2d\u3067\u3059\u3002\u518d\u63a5\u7d9a\u3057\u3066\u30db\u30b9\u30c8\u3092\u7d9a\u3051\u307e\u3057\u3087\u3046\u3002","\u0906\u092a\u0928\u0947 \u090f\u0915 \u092e\u0932\u094d\u091f\u0940-\u092b\u093c\u094b\u0928 \u0915\u092e\u0930\u093e \u092c\u0928\u093e\u092f\u093e \u0925\u093e \u091c\u094b \u0905\u092d\u0940 \u092d\u0940 \u092a\u094d\u0930\u0924\u0940\u0915\u094d\u0937\u093e \u0915\u0930 \u0930\u0939\u093e \u0939\u0948\u0964 \u0939\u094b\u0938\u094d\u091f\u093f\u0902\u0917 \u091c\u093e\u0930\u0940 \u0930\u0916\u0928\u0947 \u0915\u0947 \u0932\u093f\u090f \u092b\u093f\u0930 \u0938\u0947 \u0915\u0928\u0947\u0915\u094d\u091f \u0915\u0930\u0947\u0902\u0964","Anda membuat ruang multi-ponsel yang masih menunggu. Sambungkan kembali untuk terus menjadi host.","B\u1ea1n \u0111\xe3 t\u1ea1o m\u1ed9t ph\xf2ng nhi\u1ec1u \u0111i\u1ec7n tho\u1ea1i v\u1eabn \u0111ang ch\u1edd. K\u1ebft n\u1ed1i l\u1ea1i \u0111\u1ec3 ti\u1ebfp t\u1ee5c l\xe0m ch\u1ee7 tr\xec."],t.s)
B.a24=s(["Descartar","Ignorer","Verwerfen","Descartar","\u9589\u3058\u308b","\u0916\u093e\u0930\u093f\u091c \u0915\u0930\u0947\u0902","Abaikan","B\u1ecf qua"],t.s)
B.a2K=s(["es un juego de dados para tel\xe9fonos y la web desarrollado con Flutter y Dart. Admite jugadores humanos y robots, puntuaci\xf3n de las secciones superior e inferior, bono de la secci\xf3n superior, bono de cinco iguales, historial guardado, pistas y la presentaci\xf3n compartida de T-G-Apps.","est un jeu de d\xe9s pour t\xe9l\xe9phone et le Web d\xe9velopp\xe9 avec Flutter et Dart. Il prend en charge les joueurs humains et robots, les sections sup\xe9rieure et inf\xe9rieure, le bonus sup\xe9rieur, le bonus de cinq identiques, l\u2019historique enregistr\xe9, les indices et la pr\xe9sentation commune de T-G-Apps.","ist ein mit Flutter und Dart entwickeltes W\xfcrfelspiel f\xfcr Smartphones und das Web. Es unterst\xfctzt Menschen und Roboter, obere und untere Wertung, oberen Bonus, F\xfcnfling-Bonus, gespeicherten Verlauf, Hinweise und die gemeinsame T-G-Apps-Darstellung.","\xe9 um jogo de dados para celular e web desenvolvido com Flutter e Dart. Oferece jogadores humanos e rob\xf4s, pontua\xe7\xe3o superior e inferior, b\xf4nus superior, b\xf4nus de cinco iguais, hist\xf3rico salvo, dicas e a apresenta\xe7\xe3o compartilhada da T-G-Apps.","\u306fFlutter\u3068Dart\u3067\u958b\u767a\u3055\u308c\u305f\u30b9\u30de\u30fc\u30c8\u30d5\u30a9\u30f3\u304a\u3088\u3073Web\u5411\u3051\u30c0\u30a4\u30b9\u30b2\u30fc\u30e0\u3067\u3059\u3002\u4eba\u9593\u3068\u30ed\u30dc\u30c3\u30c8\u306e\u30d7\u30ec\u30a4\u30e4\u30fc\u3001\u4e0a\u4e0b\u6bb5\u306e\u5f97\u70b9\u3001\u4e0a\u6bb5\u30dc\u30fc\u30ca\u30b9\u3001\u30d5\u30a1\u30a4\u30d6\u30fb\u30aa\u30d6\u30fb\u30a2\u30fb\u30ab\u30a4\u30f3\u30c9\u30fb\u30dc\u30fc\u30ca\u30b9\u3001\u5c65\u6b74\u4fdd\u5b58\u3001\u30d2\u30f3\u30c8\u3001T-G-Apps\u5171\u901a\u30c7\u30b6\u30a4\u30f3\u306b\u5bfe\u5fdc\u3057\u3066\u3044\u307e\u3059\u3002","Flutter\u0914\u0930Dart\u0938\u0947 \u0935\u093f\u0915\u0938\u093f\u0924 \u090f\u0915 \u092b\u093c\u094b\u0928 \u0914\u0930 \u0935\u0947\u092c \u0921\u093e\u0907\u0938 \u0917\u0947\u092e \u0939\u0948\u0964 \u092f\u0939 \u092e\u093e\u0928\u0935 \u0914\u0930 \u0930\u094b\u092c\u094b\u091f \u0916\u093f\u0932\u093e\u0921\u093c\u093f\u092f\u094b\u0902, \u090a\u092a\u0930\u0940 \u0914\u0930 \u0928\u093f\u091a\u0932\u0947 \u0916\u0902\u0921 \u0938\u094d\u0915\u094b\u0930\u093f\u0902\u0917, \u090a\u092a\u0930\u0940-\u0916\u0902\u0921 \u092c\u094b\u0928\u0938, \u092a\u093e\u0902\u091a \u0938\u092e\u093e\u0928 \u092c\u094b\u0928\u0938, \u0938\u0939\u0947\u091c\u093e \u0917\u092f\u093e \u0916\u093f\u0932\u093e\u0921\u093c\u0940 \u0907\u0924\u093f\u0939\u093e\u0938, \u0938\u0902\u0915\u0947\u0924, \u0914\u0930 \u0938\u093e\u091d\u093e T-G-Apps \u092a\u094d\u0930\u0938\u094d\u0924\u0941\u0924\u093f \u0915\u093e \u0938\u092e\u0930\u094d\u0925\u0928 \u0915\u0930\u0924\u093e \u0939\u0948\u0964","adalah permainan dadu ponsel dan web yang dikembangkan dengan Flutter dan Dart. Mendukung pemain manusia dan robot, penilaian bagian atas dan bawah, bonus bagian atas, bonus Lima Sejenis, riwayat pemain tersimpan, petunjuk, dan tampilan T-G-Apps bersama.","l\xe0 tr\xf2 ch\u01a1i x\xfac x\u1eafc tr\xean \u0111i\u1ec7n tho\u1ea1i v\xe0 web \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c ph\xe1t tri\u1ec3n b\u1eb1ng Flutter v\xe0 Dart. H\u1ed7 tr\u1ee3 ng\u01b0\u1eddi ch\u01a1i l\xe0 ng\u01b0\u1eddi v\xe0 robot, t\xednh \u0111i\u1ec3m ph\u1ea7n tr\xean v\xe0 ph\u1ea7n d\u01b0\u1edbi, th\u01b0\u1edfng ph\u1ea7n tr\xean, th\u01b0\u1edfng N\u0103m Gi\u1ed1ng Nhau, l\u1ecbch s\u1eed ng\u01b0\u1eddi ch\u01a1i \u0111\xe3 l\u01b0u, g\u1ee3i \xfd, v\xe0 giao di\u1ec7n T-G-Apps chung."],t.s)
B.U8=s(["El Jugador 1 siempre es Humano en modo Pasar y jugar.","Le Joueur 1 est toujours Humain en mode Passe-et-joue.","Spieler 1 ist im Weitergabe-Spiel immer ein Mensch.","O Jogador 1 \xe9 sempre Humano no modo Passa-e-joga.","\u30d1\u30b9\uff06\u30d7\u30ec\u30a4\u3067\u306f\u3001\u30d7\u30ec\u30a4\u30e4\u30fc1\u306f\u5e38\u306b\u4eba\u9593\u3067\u3059\u3002","\u092a\u093e\u0938-\u090f\u0902\u0921-\u092a\u094d\u0932\u0947 \u092e\u0947\u0902 \u092a\u094d\u0932\u0947\u092f\u0930 1 \u0939\u092e\u0947\u0936\u093e \u092e\u093e\u0928\u0935 \u0939\u094b\u0924\u093e \u0939\u0948\u0964","Pemain 1 selalu Manusia dalam mode Oper dan Main.","Ng\u01b0\u1eddi ch\u01a1i 1 lu\xf4n l\xe0 Ng\u01b0\u1eddi trong ch\u1ebf \u0111\u1ed9 Chuy\u1ec1n tay v\xe0 ch\u01a1i."],t.s)
B.Ze=s(["La sala se inici\xf3 correctamente.","La salle a d\xe9marr\xe9 avec succ\xe8s.","Der Raum wurde erfolgreich gestartet.","A sala foi iniciada com sucesso.","\u30eb\u30fc\u30e0\u304c\u6b63\u5e38\u306b\u958b\u59cb\u3055\u308c\u307e\u3057\u305f\u3002","\u0915\u092e\u0930\u093e \u0938\u092b\u0932\u0924\u093e\u092a\u0942\u0930\u094d\u0935\u0915 \u0936\u0941\u0930\u0942 \u0939\u094b \u0917\u092f\u093e \u0939\u0948\u0964","Ruang berhasil dimulai.","Ph\xf2ng \u0111\xe3 b\u1eaft \u0111\u1ea7u th\xe0nh c\xf4ng."],t.s)
B.a9A=s(["Abriendo la partida sincronizada de T-G-Apps YZ en este tel\xe9fono\u2026","Ouverture de la partie synchronis\xe9e T-G-Apps YZ sur ce t\xe9l\xe9phone\u2026","Das synchronisierte T-G-Apps-YZ-Spiel wird auf diesem Telefon ge\xf6ffnet\u2026","Abrindo o jogo sincronizado do T-G-Apps YZ neste celular\u2026","\u3053\u306e\u7aef\u672b\u3067\u540c\u671f\u3055\u308c\u305fT-G-Apps YZ\u306e\u30b2\u30fc\u30e0\u3092\u958b\u3044\u3066\u3044\u307e\u3059\u2026","\u0907\u0938 \u092b\u093c\u094b\u0928 \u092a\u0930 \u0938\u093f\u0902\u0915\u094d\u0930\u094b\u0928\u093e\u0907\u091c\u093c\u094d\u0921 T-G-Apps YZ \u0917\u0947\u092e \u0916\u094b\u0932\u093e \u091c\u093e \u0930\u0939\u093e \u0939\u0948\u2026","Membuka permainan T-G-Apps YZ yang tersinkron di ponsel ini\u2026","\u0110ang m\u1edf tr\xf2 ch\u01a1i T-G-Apps YZ \u0111\u1ed3ng b\u1ed9 tr\xean \u0111i\u1ec7n tho\u1ea1i n\xe0y\u2026"],t.s)
B.a0X=s(["Si me desconecto","Si je suis d\xe9connect\xe9","Wenn ich die Verbindung verliere","Se eu me desconectar","\u63a5\u7d9a\u304c\u5207\u308c\u305f\u5834\u5408","\u0905\u0917\u0930 \u092e\u0947\u0930\u093e \u0915\u0928\u0947\u0915\u094d\u0936\u0928 \u091f\u0942\u091f \u091c\u093e\u090f","Jika Saya Terputus","N\u1ebfu t\xf4i b\u1ecb m\u1ea5t k\u1ebft n\u1ed1i"],t.s)
B.a8Z=s(["Qu\xe9 debe pasar con tu turno si tu tel\xe9fono se desconecta a mitad de la partida.","Ce qui doit se passer pour votre tour si votre t\xe9l\xe9phone se d\xe9connecte en cours de partie.","Was mit deiner Runde passieren soll, wenn dein Telefon w\xe4hrend des Spiels die Verbindung verliert.","O que deve acontecer com sua vez se o seu celular perder a conex\xe3o no meio da partida.","\u30b2\u30fc\u30e0\u306e\u9014\u4e2d\u3067\u7aef\u672b\u306e\u63a5\u7d9a\u304c\u5207\u308c\u305f\u5834\u5408\u3001\u3042\u306a\u305f\u306e\u756a\u3092\u3069\u3046\u6271\u3046\u304b\u3002","\u0905\u0917\u0930 \u0916\u0947\u0932 \u0915\u0947 \u092c\u0940\u091a \u092e\u0947\u0902 \u0906\u092a\u0915\u0947 \u092b\u093c\u094b\u0928 \u0915\u093e \u0915\u0928\u0947\u0915\u094d\u0936\u0928 \u091f\u0942\u091f \u091c\u093e\u090f, \u0924\u094b \u0906\u092a\u0915\u0940 \u092c\u093e\u0930\u0940 \u0915\u093e \u0915\u094d\u092f\u093e \u0939\u094b\u0928\u093e \u091a\u093e\u0939\u093f\u090f\u0964","Apa yang harus terjadi pada giliran Anda jika ponsel Anda terputus di tengah permainan.","\u0110i\u1ec1u g\xec n\xean x\u1ea3y ra v\u1edbi l\u01b0\u1ee3t c\u1ee7a b\u1ea1n n\u1ebfu \u0111i\u1ec7n tho\u1ea1i m\u1ea5t k\u1ebft n\u1ed1i gi\u1eefa v\xe1n ch\u01a1i."],t.s)
B.a0O=s(["Abandonar el turno","Abandonner le tour","Runde aufgeben","Abandonar a vez","\u3053\u306e\u30bf\u30fc\u30f3\u3092\u653e\u68c4\u3059\u308b","\u092c\u093e\u0930\u0940 \u091b\u094b\u0921\u093c \u0926\u0947\u0902","Batalkan giliran","B\u1ecf l\u01b0\u1ee3t ch\u01a1i"],t.s)
B.a8v=s(["El robot juega por m\xed hasta que me reconecte","Le robot joue \xe0 ma place jusqu\u2019\xe0 ce que je me reconnecte","Der Roboter spielt f\xfcr mich, bis ich wieder verbunden bin","O rob\xf4 joga por mim at\xe9 eu me reconectar","\u518d\u63a5\u7d9a\u3059\u308b\u307e\u3067\u30ed\u30dc\u30c3\u30c8\u304c\u4ee3\u308f\u308a\u306b\u30d7\u30ec\u30a4\u3057\u307e\u3059","\u091c\u092c \u0924\u0915 \u092e\u0948\u0902 \u092b\u093f\u0930 \u0938\u0947 \u0915\u0928\u0947\u0915\u094d\u091f \u0928 \u0939\u094b \u091c\u093e\u090a\u0902, \u0924\u092c \u0924\u0915 \u0930\u094b\u092c\u094b\u091f \u092e\u0947\u0930\u0940 \u0913\u0930 \u0938\u0947 \u0916\u0947\u0932\u0947\u0917\u093e","Robot bermain untuk saya sampai saya tersambung kembali","Robot ch\u01a1i thay t\xf4i cho \u0111\u1ebfn khi t\xf4i k\u1ebft n\u1ed1i l\u1ea1i"],t.s)
B.Yv=s(["El anfitri\xf3n se ha desconectado.","L\u2019h\xf4te s\u2019est d\xe9connect\xe9.","Der Host hat die Verbindung verloren.","O anfitri\xe3o se desconectou.","\u30db\u30b9\u30c8\u306e\u63a5\u7d9a\u304c\u5207\u308c\u307e\u3057\u305f\u3002","\u0939\u094b\u0938\u094d\u091f \u0921\u093f\u0938\u094d\u0915\u0928\u0947\u0915\u094d\u091f \u0939\u094b \u0917\u092f\u093e \u0939\u0948\u0964","Host telah terputus.","Ng\u01b0\u1eddi ch\u1ee7 tr\xec \u0111\xe3 m\u1ea5t k\u1ebft n\u1ed1i."],t.s)
B.a5h=s(["La partida multitel\xe9fono se ejecuta en el tel\xe9fono del anfitri\xf3n, as\xed que no puede continuar sin \xe9l. Si el anfitri\xf3n se reconecta pronto, la partida se reanudar\xe1 por s\xed sola.","La partie multi-t\xe9l\xe9phone s\u2019ex\xe9cute sur le t\xe9l\xe9phone de l\u2019h\xf4te, elle ne peut donc pas continuer sans lui. Si l\u2019h\xf4te se reconnecte rapidement, la partie reprendra automatiquement.","Das Mehrger\xe4te-Spiel l\xe4uft auf dem Telefon des Hosts und kann ohne dieses nicht fortgesetzt werden. Verbindet sich der Host bald wieder, l\xe4uft das Spiel von selbst weiter.","O jogo em v\xe1rios celulares roda no celular do anfitri\xe3o, ent\xe3o n\xe3o pode continuar sem ele. Se o anfitri\xe3o se reconectar em breve, o jogo ser\xe1 retomado automaticamente.","\u8907\u6570\u7aef\u672b\u30b2\u30fc\u30e0\u306f\u30db\u30b9\u30c8\u306e\u7aef\u672b\u4e0a\u3067\u52d5\u4f5c\u3057\u3066\u3044\u308b\u305f\u3081\u3001\u30db\u30b9\u30c8\u304c\u3044\u306a\u3044\u3068\u7d9a\u884c\u3067\u304d\u307e\u305b\u3093\u3002\u30db\u30b9\u30c8\u304c\u307e\u3082\u306a\u304f\u518d\u63a5\u7d9a\u3059\u308c\u3070\u3001\u30b2\u30fc\u30e0\u306f\u81ea\u52d5\u7684\u306b\u518d\u958b\u3057\u307e\u3059\u3002","\u092e\u0932\u094d\u091f\u0940-\u092b\u093c\u094b\u0928 \u0917\u0947\u092e \u0939\u094b\u0938\u094d\u091f \u0915\u0947 \u092b\u093c\u094b\u0928 \u092a\u0930 \u091a\u0932\u0924\u093e \u0939\u0948, \u0907\u0938\u0932\u093f\u090f \u0909\u0938\u0915\u0947 \u092c\u093f\u0928\u093e \u092f\u0939 \u091c\u093e\u0930\u0940 \u0928\u0939\u0940\u0902 \u0930\u0939 \u0938\u0915\u0924\u093e\u0964 \u0905\u0917\u0930 \u0939\u094b\u0938\u094d\u091f \u091c\u0932\u094d\u0926 \u0939\u0940 \u092b\u093f\u0930 \u0938\u0947 \u0915\u0928\u0947\u0915\u094d\u091f \u0939\u094b \u091c\u093e\u0924\u093e \u0939\u0948, \u0924\u094b \u092f\u0939 \u0917\u0947\u092e \u0905\u092a\u0928\u0947 \u0906\u092a \u092b\u093f\u0930 \u0938\u0947 \u0936\u0941\u0930\u0942 \u0939\u094b \u091c\u093e\u090f\u0917\u093e\u0964","Permainan multi-ponsel berjalan di ponsel host, jadi tidak dapat dilanjutkan tanpanya. Jika host tersambung kembali segera, permainan ini akan otomatis dilanjutkan.","Tr\xf2 ch\u01a1i nhi\u1ec1u \u0111i\u1ec7n tho\u1ea1i ch\u1ea1y tr\xean \u0111i\u1ec7n tho\u1ea1i c\u1ee7a ng\u01b0\u1eddi ch\u1ee7 tr\xec, n\xean kh\xf4ng th\u1ec3 ti\u1ebfp t\u1ee5c n\u1ebfu thi\u1ebfu \u0111i\u1ec7n tho\u1ea1i \u0111\xf3. N\u1ebfu ng\u01b0\u1eddi ch\u1ee7 tr\xec k\u1ebft n\u1ed1i l\u1ea1i s\u1edbm, tr\xf2 ch\u01a1i s\u1ebd t\u1ef1 \u0111\u1ed9ng ti\u1ebfp t\u1ee5c."],t.s)
B.a90=s(["Un jugador crea la sala y comparte su c\xf3digo de seis caracteres. Los dem\xe1s jugadores humanos se unen a esa sala desde sus tel\xe9fonos.","Un joueur cr\xe9e la salle et partage son code \xe0 six caract\xe8res. Les autres joueurs humains rejoignent cette salle depuis leurs t\xe9l\xe9phones.","Ein Spieler erstellt den Raum und teilt dessen sechsstelligen Code. Andere menschliche Spieler treten diesem Raum von ihren Telefonen aus bei.","Um jogador cria a sala e compartilha seu c\xf3digo de seis caracteres. Os demais jogadores humanos entram nessa sala pelos pr\xf3prios celulares.","1\u4eba\u306e\u30d7\u30ec\u30a4\u30e4\u30fc\u304c\u30eb\u30fc\u30e0\u3092\u4f5c\u6210\u3057\u30016\u6587\u5b57\u306e\u30b3\u30fc\u30c9\u3092\u5171\u6709\u3057\u307e\u3059\u3002\u4ed6\u306e\u4eba\u9593\u30d7\u30ec\u30a4\u30e4\u30fc\u306f\u81ea\u5206\u306e\u7aef\u672b\u304b\u3089\u305d\u306e\u30eb\u30fc\u30e0\u306b\u53c2\u52a0\u3057\u307e\u3059\u3002","\u090f\u0915 \u0916\u093f\u0932\u093e\u0921\u093c\u0940 \u0915\u092e\u0930\u093e \u092c\u0928\u093e\u0924\u093e \u0939\u0948 \u0914\u0930 \u0909\u0938\u0915\u093e \u091b\u0939-\u0905\u0915\u094d\u0937\u0930 \u0915\u094b\u0921 \u0938\u093e\u091d\u093e \u0915\u0930\u0924\u093e \u0939\u0948\u0964 \u0905\u0928\u094d\u092f \u092e\u093e\u0928\u0935 \u0916\u093f\u0932\u093e\u0921\u093c\u0940 \u0905\u092a\u0928\u0947 \u092b\u093c\u094b\u0928 \u0938\u0947 \u0909\u0938 \u0915\u092e\u0930\u0947 \u092e\u0947\u0902 \u0936\u093e\u092e\u093f\u0932 \u0939\u094b\u0924\u0947 \u0939\u0948\u0902\u0964","Satu pemain membuat ruang dan membagikan kode enam karakternya. Pemain manusia lain bergabung ke ruang itu dari ponsel mereka.","M\u1ed9t ng\u01b0\u1eddi ch\u01a1i t\u1ea1o ph\xf2ng v\xe0 chia s\u1ebb m\xe3 s\xe1u k\xfd t\u1ef1 c\u1ee7a ph\xf2ng. Nh\u1eefng ng\u01b0\u1eddi ch\u01a1i kh\xe1c tham gia ph\xf2ng \u0111\xf3 t\u1eeb \u0111i\u1ec7n tho\u1ea1i c\u1ee7a h\u1ecd."],t.s)
B.a22=s(["Las partidas multitel\xe9fono son solo para jugadores humanos. El tel\xe9fono anfitri\xf3n tambi\xe9n puede controlar asientos humanos locales combinando Pasar y jugar.","Les parties multi-t\xe9l\xe9phone sont r\xe9serv\xe9es aux joueurs humains. Le t\xe9l\xe9phone h\xf4te peut aussi contr\xf4ler des places humaines locales en combinant le mode Passe-et-joue.","Mehrger\xe4te-Spiele sind nur f\xfcr menschliche Spieler. Das Host-Telefon kann zus\xe4tzlich lokale menschliche Pl\xe4tze im kombinierten Weitergabe-Spiel steuern.","Os jogos em v\xe1rios celulares s\xe3o apenas para humanos. O celular anfitri\xe3o tamb\xe9m pode controlar assentos humanos locais combinando o modo Passa-e-joga.","\u8907\u6570\u7aef\u672b\u30b2\u30fc\u30e0\u306f\u4eba\u9593\u5c02\u7528\u3067\u3059\u3002\u30db\u30b9\u30c8\u7aef\u672b\u306f\u30d1\u30b9\uff06\u30d7\u30ec\u30a4\u3092\u7d44\u307f\u5408\u308f\u305b\u3066\u3001\u30ed\u30fc\u30ab\u30eb\u306e\u4eba\u9593\u30d7\u30ec\u30a4\u30e4\u30fc\u5e2d\u3082\u64cd\u4f5c\u3067\u304d\u307e\u3059\u3002","\u092e\u0932\u094d\u091f\u0940-\u092b\u093c\u094b\u0928 \u0917\u0947\u092e \u0915\u0947\u0935\u0932 \u092e\u093e\u0928\u0935 \u0915\u0947 \u0932\u093f\u090f \u0939\u094b\u0924\u0947 \u0939\u0948\u0902\u0964 \u0939\u094b\u0938\u094d\u091f \u092b\u093c\u094b\u0928 \u0938\u0902\u092f\u0941\u0915\u094d\u0924 \u092a\u093e\u0938-\u090f\u0902\u0921-\u092a\u094d\u0932\u0947 \u0915\u0947 \u0932\u093f\u090f \u0938\u094d\u0925\u093e\u0928\u0940\u092f \u092e\u093e\u0928\u0935 \u0938\u0940\u091f\u094b\u0902 \u0915\u094b \u092d\u0940 \u0928\u093f\u092f\u0902\u0924\u094d\u0930\u093f\u0924 \u0915\u0930 \u0938\u0915\u0924\u093e \u0939\u0948\u0964","Permainan multi-ponsel hanya untuk manusia. Ponsel host juga dapat mengontrol kursi manusia lokal untuk Oper dan Main gabungan.","Tr\xf2 ch\u01a1i nhi\u1ec1u \u0111i\u1ec7n tho\u1ea1i ch\u1ec9 d\xe0nh cho ng\u01b0\u1eddi. \u0110i\u1ec7n tho\u1ea1i ch\u1ee7 tr\xec c\u0169ng c\xf3 th\u1ec3 \u0111i\u1ec1u khi\u1ec3n c\xe1c v\u1ecb tr\xed ng\u01b0\u1eddi ch\u01a1i c\u1ee5c b\u1ed9 \u0111\u1ec3 k\u1ebft h\u1ee3p Chuy\u1ec1n tay v\xe0 ch\u01a1i."],t.s)
B.a2W=s(["Firebase usa una identidad de aplicaci\xf3n an\xf3nima para cada tel\xe9fono. Los jugadores no necesitan compartir direcciones de correo ni cuentas de Google.","Firebase utilise une identit\xe9 d\u2019application anonyme pour chaque t\xe9l\xe9phone. Les joueurs n\u2019ont pas besoin de partager leur adresse e-mail ni leur compte Google.","Firebase verwendet f\xfcr jedes Telefon eine anonyme App-Identit\xe4t. Spieler m\xfcssen keine E-Mail-Adressen oder Google-Konten teilen.","O Firebase usa uma identidade de aplicativo an\xf4nima para cada celular. Os jogadores n\xe3o precisam compartilhar endere\xe7os de e-mail nem contas do Google.","Firebase\u306f\u7aef\u672b\u3054\u3068\u306b\u533f\u540d\u306e\u30a2\u30d7\u30eaID\u3092\u4f7f\u7528\u3057\u307e\u3059\u3002\u30d7\u30ec\u30a4\u30e4\u30fc\u304c\u30e1\u30fc\u30eb\u30a2\u30c9\u30ec\u30b9\u3084Google\u30a2\u30ab\u30a6\u30f3\u30c8\u3092\u5171\u6709\u3059\u308b\u5fc5\u8981\u306f\u3042\u308a\u307e\u305b\u3093\u3002","Firebase \u092a\u094d\u0930\u0924\u094d\u092f\u0947\u0915 \u092b\u093c\u094b\u0928 \u0915\u0947 \u0932\u093f\u090f \u090f\u0915 \u0905\u091c\u094d\u091e\u093e\u0924 \u0910\u092a \u092a\u0939\u091a\u093e\u0928 \u0915\u093e \u0909\u092a\u092f\u094b\u0917 \u0915\u0930\u0924\u093e \u0939\u0948\u0964 \u0916\u093f\u0932\u093e\u0921\u093c\u093f\u092f\u094b\u0902 \u0915\u094b \u0908\u092e\u0947\u0932 \u092a\u0924\u093e \u092f\u093e Google \u0916\u093e\u0924\u093e \u0938\u093e\u091d\u093e \u0915\u0930\u0928\u0947 \u0915\u0940 \u0906\u0935\u0936\u094d\u092f\u0915\u0924\u093e \u0928\u0939\u0940\u0902 \u0939\u0948\u0964","Firebase menggunakan identitas aplikasi anonim untuk setiap ponsel. Pemain tidak perlu membagikan alamat email atau akun Google.","Firebase s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng danh t\xednh \u1ee9ng d\u1ee5ng \u1ea9n danh cho m\u1ed7i \u0111i\u1ec7n tho\u1ea1i. Ng\u01b0\u1eddi ch\u01a1i kh\xf4ng c\u1ea7n chia s\u1ebb \u0111\u1ecba ch\u1ec9 email ho\u1eb7c t\xe0i kho\u1ea3n Google."],t.s)
B.a6h=s(["Bono de cinco iguales \u2022 autom\xe1tico","Bonus de cinq identiques \u2022 automatique","F\xfcnfling-Bonus \u2022 automatisch","B\xf4nus de cinco iguais \u2022 autom\xe1tico","\u30d5\u30a1\u30a4\u30d6\u30fb\u30aa\u30d6\u30fb\u30a2\u30fb\u30ab\u30a4\u30f3\u30c9\u30fb\u30dc\u30fc\u30ca\u30b9\u30fb\u81ea\u52d5","\u092a\u093e\u0902\u091a \u0938\u092e\u093e\u0928 \u092c\u094b\u0928\u0938 \u2022 \u0938\u094d\u0935\u091a\u093e\u0932\u093f\u0924","Bonus Lima Sejenis \u2022 otomatis","Th\u01b0\u1edfng N\u0103m Gi\u1ed1ng Nhau \u2022 t\u1ef1 \u0111\u1ed9ng"],t.s)
B.Vs=s(["Pide al anfitri\xf3n el c\xf3digo de sala que aparece en la sala de espera. Ocupar\xe1s el siguiente asiento humano remoto disponible.","Demandez \xe0 l\u2019h\xf4te le code de salle affich\xe9 dans le salon. Vous occuperez la prochaine place humaine \xe0 distance disponible.","Bitte den Gastgeber um den in der Lobby angezeigten Raumcode. Du erh\xe4ltst den n\xe4chsten verf\xfcgbaren Remote-Platz f\xfcr Menschen.","Pe\xe7a ao anfitri\xe3o o c\xf3digo de sala exibido na sala de espera. Voc\xea ocupar\xe1 o pr\xf3ximo assento humano remoto dispon\xedvel.","\u30ed\u30d3\u30fc\u306b\u8868\u793a\u3055\u308c\u3066\u3044\u308b\u30eb\u30fc\u30e0\u30b3\u30fc\u30c9\u3092\u30db\u30b9\u30c8\u306b\u805e\u3044\u3066\u304f\u3060\u3055\u3044\u3002\u6b21\u306b\u7a7a\u3044\u3066\u3044\u308b\u30ea\u30e2\u30fc\u30c8\u4eba\u9593\u5e2d\u306b\u7740\u5e2d\u3057\u307e\u3059\u3002","\u0932\u0949\u092c\u0940 \u092e\u0947\u0902 \u0926\u093f\u0916\u093e\u090f \u0917\u090f \u0915\u092e\u0930\u0947 \u0915\u0947 \u0915\u094b\u0921 \u0915\u0947 \u0932\u093f\u090f \u0939\u094b\u0938\u094d\u091f \u0938\u0947 \u092a\u0942\u091b\u0947\u0902\u0964 \u0906\u092a\u0915\u094b \u0905\u0917\u0932\u0940 \u0909\u092a\u0932\u092c\u094d\u0927 \u0930\u093f\u092e\u094b\u091f \u092e\u093e\u0928\u0935 \u0938\u0940\u091f \u092e\u093f\u0932 \u091c\u093e\u090f\u0917\u0940\u0964","Tanyakan kode ruang yang ditampilkan di lobi kepada host. Anda akan mendapatkan kursi manusia jarak jauh berikutnya yang tersedia.","H\xe3y h\u1ecfi ch\u1ee7 tr\xec m\xe3 ph\xf2ng hi\u1ec3n th\u1ecb trong s\u1ea3nh ch\u1edd. B\u1ea1n s\u1ebd nh\u1eadn v\u1ecb tr\xed ng\u01b0\u1eddi ch\u01a1i t\u1eeb xa ti\u1ebfp theo c\xf2n tr\u1ed1ng."],t.s)
B.a8e=s(["Todos los jugadores son humanos. Los asientos \xabHumano en este tel\xe9fono\xbb usan Pasar y jugar en el tel\xe9fono anfitri\xf3n; los asientos humanos remotos se ocupan desde otros tel\xe9fonos.","Tous les joueurs sont humains. Les places \xab Humain sur ce t\xe9l\xe9phone \xbb utilisent le mode Passe-et-joue sur le t\xe9l\xe9phone h\xf4te ; les places humaines \xe0 distance sont occup\xe9es depuis d\u2019autres t\xe9l\xe9phones.","Alle Spieler sind Menschen. Pl\xe4tze mit \u201eMensch auf diesem Telefon\u201c nutzen das Weitergabe-Spiel auf dem Host-Telefon; Remote-Pl\xe4tze f\xfcr Menschen werden von anderen Telefonen aus belegt.","Todos os jogadores s\xe3o humanos. Os assentos \u201cHumano neste celular\u201d usam o modo Passa-e-joga no celular anfitri\xe3o; os assentos humanos remotos s\xe3o ocupados a partir de outros celulares.","\u5168\u54e1\u304c\u4eba\u9593\u30d7\u30ec\u30a4\u30e4\u30fc\u3067\u3059\u3002\u300c\u3053\u306e\u7aef\u672b\u306e\u4eba\u9593\u300d\u5e2d\u306f\u30db\u30b9\u30c8\u7aef\u672b\u3067\u30d1\u30b9\uff06\u30d7\u30ec\u30a4\u3092\u4f7f\u7528\u3057\u3001\u30ea\u30e2\u30fc\u30c8\u4eba\u9593\u5e2d\u306f\u4ed6\u306e\u7aef\u672b\u304b\u3089\u53c2\u52a0\u3057\u307e\u3059\u3002",'\u0938\u092d\u0940 \u0916\u093f\u0932\u093e\u0921\u093c\u0940 \u092e\u093e\u0928\u0935 \u0939\u0948\u0902\u0964 "\u0907\u0938 \u092b\u093c\u094b\u0928 \u092a\u0930 \u092e\u093e\u0928\u0935" \u0938\u0940\u091f\u0947\u0902 \u0939\u094b\u0938\u094d\u091f \u092b\u093c\u094b\u0928 \u092a\u0930 \u092a\u093e\u0938-\u090f\u0902\u0921-\u092a\u094d\u0932\u0947 \u0915\u093e \u0909\u092a\u092f\u094b\u0917 \u0915\u0930\u0924\u0940 \u0939\u0948\u0902; \u0930\u093f\u092e\u094b\u091f \u092e\u093e\u0928\u0935 \u0938\u0940\u091f\u0947\u0902 \u0905\u0928\u094d\u092f \u092b\u093c\u094b\u0928 \u0938\u0947 \u0932\u0940 \u091c\u093e\u0924\u0940 \u0939\u0948\u0902\u0964','Semua pemain adalah manusia. Kursi "Manusia di ponsel ini" menggunakan Oper dan Main di ponsel host; kursi manusia jarak jauh diambil dari ponsel lain.','T\u1ea5t c\u1ea3 ng\u01b0\u1eddi ch\u01a1i \u0111\u1ec1u l\xe0 ng\u01b0\u1eddi. V\u1ecb tr\xed "Ng\u01b0\u1eddi tr\xean \u0111i\u1ec7n tho\u1ea1i n\xe0y" d\xf9ng ch\u1ebf \u0111\u1ed9 Chuy\u1ec1n tay v\xe0 ch\u01a1i tr\xean \u0111i\u1ec7n tho\u1ea1i ch\u1ee7 tr\xec; v\u1ecb tr\xed ng\u01b0\u1eddi ch\u01a1i t\u1eeb xa \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c nh\u1eadn t\u1eeb c\xe1c \u0111i\u1ec7n tho\u1ea1i kh\xe1c.'],t.s)
B.a10=s(["El Jugador 1 siempre es un humano controlado por el tel\xe9fono anfitri\xf3n.","Le Joueur 1 est toujours un humain contr\xf4l\xe9 par le t\xe9l\xe9phone h\xf4te.","Spieler 1 ist immer ein Mensch, der vom Host-Telefon gesteuert wird.","O Jogador 1 \xe9 sempre um humano controlado pelo celular anfitri\xe3o.","\u30d7\u30ec\u30a4\u30e4\u30fc1\u306f\u5e38\u306b\u30db\u30b9\u30c8\u7aef\u672b\u304c\u64cd\u4f5c\u3059\u308b\u4eba\u9593\u3067\u3059\u3002","\u092a\u094d\u0932\u0947\u092f\u0930 1 \u0939\u092e\u0947\u0936\u093e \u0939\u094b\u0938\u094d\u091f \u092b\u093c\u094b\u0928 \u0926\u094d\u0935\u093e\u0930\u093e \u0928\u093f\u092f\u0902\u0924\u094d\u0930\u093f\u0924 \u090f\u0915 \u092e\u093e\u0928\u0935 \u0939\u094b\u0924\u093e \u0939\u0948\u0964","Pemain 1 selalu manusia yang dikendalikan oleh ponsel host.","Ng\u01b0\u1eddi ch\u01a1i 1 lu\xf4n l\xe0 ng\u01b0\u1eddi do \u0111i\u1ec7n tho\u1ea1i ch\u1ee7 tr\xec \u0111i\u1ec1u khi\u1ec3n."],t.s)
B.a5i=s(["Suma de todos los unos.","Total de tous les As.","Summe aller Einser.","Total de todos os Uns.","1\u306e\u76ee\u306e\u5408\u8a08\u3002","\u0938\u092d\u0940 1 \u0915\u093e \u092f\u094b\u0917\u0964","Total semua angka 1.","T\u1ed5ng t\u1ea5t c\u1ea3 m\u1eb7t 1."],t.s)
